[sub_resource type="Environment" id="Environment_env"]
# v0.2.1 black-screen fix: NO ProceduralSky / Sky ambient / fog / ACES.
# Sky-based environments rendered pure black on Android (Mobile renderer)
# in the v0.2 APK even though the scene ran fine headless. A plain colour
# background + colour ambient cannot fail that way: if anything goes wrong
# the view is dusk-grey, never black. Fog is off, glow off, tonemap Filmic.
# v0.5: dusk colours (GTA IV look) — still BG_COLOR + COLOR ambient.
